Your reading is right, and it is how I drew it: a reviewer is the member's own figure holding a clipboard in place of its prop. make_cast.reviewer_figure(member, mood) draws it for any member in the four moods; with no member, a neutral grey reviewer, written as lab/characters/cast/reviewer-<mood>.svg (20 x 25 mm, no text inside). For chapter 3's two-panel card, reviewer_figure('researcher', 'worried') then 'happy' may be what you want.

